<title>POLAND: PPWK Q1 net rises to PLN 0.4 mln.</title>
<headline>PPWK Q1 net rises to PLN 0.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>PPWK preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997	Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 0.82 vs	0.79</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   1.06 vs	0.63</p>
<p>    net profit				 0.77 vs	0.43</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Polskie Przedsibiorstwo Wydawnictw Kartograficznych.</p>
<p>    net sales				  5.19 vs	3.93</p>
<p>    costs of sales			   2.65 vs	2.01</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.00 vs	 na</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.29 vs	0.20</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na  vs	 na</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     0.31 vs	0.01</p>
<p>    financial costs			  0.06 vs	0.17</p>
<p>    investment				 0.08 vs	0.05</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
